      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chilonis is a Spartan princess and has multiple marriages and children, including Areus II and Cleomenes III. She is known from Plutarch's 'Life of Pyrrhus'."|&lt;SEP&gt;"Chilonis is the daughter of Leonidas II and wife of Cleombrotus II, choosing to follow her father into exile."</data>
